{"id":29000,"slug":"i-wanna-hold-your-hand","title":"I Wanna Hold Your Hand","year":1978,"country":"United States","duration":99,"spine":967,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29000-i-wanna-hold-your-hand","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/66ba5fe958ad045a4f5b5ebe54570c97/A3LCcKjo5itwNBka6dKwl6td7sSpB0_large.jpg","description":"\nOn February 9, 1964, the Beatles made their first live appearance on American television on The Ed Sullivan Show, ratcheting up the frenzy of a fan base whose ecstatic devotion to the band heralded an explosive new wave of youth culture. I Wanna Hold Your Hand looks back to that fateful weekend, following six New Jersey teenagers, each with different reasons for wanting to see the Fab Four, on a madcap mission to Manhattan to meet the band and score tickets to the show. With this rollicking first feature, director Robert Zemeckis and cowriter Bob Gale established themselves as a film­making team par excellence, adept at mining America’s cultural memory for comedy and adventure with a winning mixture of sweet nostalgia and playful irreverence.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Robert Zemeckis","slug":"robert-zemeckis"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Nancy Allen","role":"Pam Mitchell","slug":"nancy-allen"},{"actor":"Bobby Di Cicco","role":"Tony Smerko","slug":"bobby-di-cicco"},{"actor":"Marc McClure","role":"Larry Dubois","slug":"marc-mcclure"},{"actor":"Susan Kendall Newman","role":"Janis Goldman","slug":"susan-kendall-newman"},{"actor":"Theresa Saldana","role":"Grace Corrigan","slug":"theresa-saldana"},{"actor":"Wendie Jo Sperber","role":"Rosie Petrofsky","slug":"wendie-jo-sperber"},{"actor":"Eddie Deezen","role":"Richard “Ringo” Klaus","slug":"eddie-deezen"},{"actor":"Christian Juttner","role":"Peter Plimpton","slug":"christian-juttner"},{"actor":"Murray the “K”","role":"As himself","slug":"murray-the-k"},{"actor":"Will Jordan","role":"Ed Sullivan","slug":"will-jordan"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person"